<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    @page {
      size: 8.5in 11in;
      margin: 0.5in;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
      font-size: 12pt;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0;
      max-width: 7.5in;
    }

    .page {
      page-break-after: always;
      padding: 0.5in 0;
    }

    .page:last-child {
      page-break-after: auto;
    }

    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 14pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 12pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 15px 0 8px 0;
    }

    p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    .info-box {
      border: 2px solid #000;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }

    .info-box h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .field {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 100px;
      padding: 0 5px;
    }

    .field-short {
      min-width: 80px;
    }

    .field-medium {
      min-width: 150px;
    }

    .field-long {
      min-width: 250px;
    }

    .field-full {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .checkbox-group {
      margin: 10px 0 10px 20px;
    }

    .checkbox-item {
      margin: 5px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
    }

    .checkbox {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
      border: 1px solid #000;
      margin-right: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .checkbox.checked::after {
      content: '✓';
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 15px;
    }

    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .signature-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      width: 300px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }

    .date-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      width: 150px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    table td {
      padding: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #000;
    }

    .indent {
      margin-left: 30px;
    }

    .bold {
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    ul {
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding-left: 40px;
    }

    li {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- PAGE 1 -->
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Pay and Stay Agreement</h1>

    <div class="info-box">
      <h2>About This Agreement (please read)</h2>

      <p>
        This Agreement helps a landlord and tenant resolve a rent or payment issue
        through an agreed payment arrangement. Landlord's promises about not filing
        or pursuing eviction and dismissing an existing case are stated in Section 5.
      </p>

      <p>
        Participation is voluntary. Signing may create legally enforceable obligations,
        including a promise to pay. Read the completed terms and ask questions before signing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Party Information</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Landlord / legal entity:</strong>
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="landlord_name"><%= @landlord %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Landlord's authorized representative, if applicable:</strong>
      <span class="field field-long"
            data-agreement-field="landlord_representative"><%= @landlord_representative %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Tenant(s):</strong>
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="tenant_name"><%= @tenant %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Tenant's authorized representative, if applicable:</strong>
      <span class="field field-long"
            data-agreement-field="tenant_representative"><%= @tenant_representative %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Rental property:</strong>
      <span class="field field-full" data-agreement-field="address"><%= @address %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Agreement Date:</strong>
      <span class="field field-medium"
            data-agreement-field="negotiation_date"
            data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= @date %></span>
    </p>

    <h3>1. Reason for Agreement</h3>

    <p>
      This Agreement addresses the following payment issue:
    </p>

    <p class="indent">
      <span class="field field-full"
            data-agreement-field="reason"><%= @reason %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      This Agreement is meant to help both sides resolve the issue,
      avoid eviction when possible, and create a clear plan moving forward.
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 2 -->
  <div class="page">

    <h3>2. Agreed Payment Amount</h3>

    <p>
      To resolve the payment issue identified above, Tenant agrees to pay the total agreed
      payment amount shown in the table below, under the schedule in Section 3 and subject
      to any changes expressly agreed in Sections 3 and 4. Landlord agrees to accept
      these payments under this Agreement.
    </p>

    <p>
      This agreed payment arrangement does not, by itself, establish that every charge
      originally claimed was correct.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Include only the items that apply:</strong></p>

    <table class="agreed-payment-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Item</th>
          <th>Period or description</th>
          <th>Amount</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @rent_owed.present? || @rent_period.present? %>
          <tr>
            <td>Rent</td>
            <td><span class="field" data-agreement-field="rent_period"><%= @rent_period %></span></td>
            <td>$<span data-agreement-field="rent_owed"><%= @rent_owed %></span></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @late_fees.present? || @late_fees_description.present? %>
          <tr>
            <td>Late fees, if legally permitted</td>
            <td><span class="field" data-agreement-field="late_fees_description"><%= @late_fees_description %></span></td>
            <td>$<span data-agreement-field="late_fees"><%= @late_fees %></span></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @utilities.present? || @utilities_period.present? %>
          <tr>
            <td>Utilities</td>
            <td><span class="field" data-agreement-field="utilities_period"><%= @utilities_period %></span></td>
            <td>$<span data-agreement-field="utilities"><%= @utilities %></span></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @other_charges.present? || @other_charges_description.present? %>
          <tr>
            <td>Other specifically identified charges</td>
            <td><span class="field" data-agreement-field="other_charges_description"><%= @other_charges_description %></span></td>
            <td>$<span data-agreement-field="other_charges"><%= @other_charges %></span></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @credits_amount.present? || @credits_description.present? %>
          <tr>
            <td>Less payments and credits already received</td>
            <td><span class="field" data-agreement-field="credits_description"><%= @credits_description %></span></td>
            <td>− $<span data-agreement-field="credits_amount"><%= @credits_amount %></span></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @reductions_amount.present? || @reductions_description.present? %>
          <tr>
            <td>Less agreed reductions effective when this Agreement takes effect</td>
            <td><span class="field" data-agreement-field="reductions_description"><%= @reductions_description %></span></td>
            <td>− $<span data-agreement-field="reductions_amount"><%= @reductions_amount %></span></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="2"><strong>Total agreed payment amount</strong></td>
          <td><strong>$<span data-agreement-field="money_owed"><%= @money_owed %></span></strong></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>This Agreement resolves only the payment issue identified in Section 1.</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Are there other payment issues the parties want to identify as unresolved?
      Select one.</strong>
    </p>

    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="unresolved_payment_issues"
          data-agreement-value="no">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @unresolved_payment_issues == 'no' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>No.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="unresolved_payment_issues"
          data-agreement-value="yes">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @unresolved_payment_issues == 'yes' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          Yes:
          <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @unresolved_payment_issues == "yes" %>
            <span class="field field-long"
                  data-agreement-field="unresolved_payment_details"><%= @unresolved_payment_details %></span>
          <% end %>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">


    <h3>3. Payment Plan (Pay & Stay Terms)</h3>

    <p>To resolve this balance, the tenant agrees to make the following payments:</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Regular Rent:</strong>
      Tenant will pay regular monthly rent of
      $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="monthly_rent"><%= @monthly_rent %></span>,
      due on the
      <span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="regular_rent_due_day"><%= @regular_rent_due_day %></span>
      day of each month.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Regular Rent Arrangement (Select one):</strong></p>

    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="regular_rent_arrangement"
          data-agreement-value="unchanged">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @regular_rent_arrangement == 'unchanged' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>The regular rent arrangement remains unchanged.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="regular_rent_arrangement"
          data-agreement-value="modified">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @regular_rent_arrangement == 'modified' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          The parties agree to the following change:
          <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @regular_rent_arrangement == "modified" %>
            <span class="field field-long"
                  data-agreement-field="regular_rent_change_details"><%= @regular_rent_change_details %></span>
          <% end %>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p><strong>Additional Payments Toward Balance (Check all that apply):</strong></p>

    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_lump_sum" data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_lump_sum ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          <strong>Lump Sum Payment:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="lump_sum_amount"><%= @lump_sum_amount.present? ? @lump_sum_amount : '___________' %></span>
          due on or before <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="lump_sum_date"><%= @lump_sum_date.present? ? @lump_sum_date : '___________' %></span> at 5:00 PM
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_monthly" data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_monthly ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          <strong>Monthly Payments:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_amount"><%= @monthly_payment_amount.present? ? @monthly_payment_amount : '___________' %></span>
          per month for <span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_months"><%= @monthly_payment_months.present? ? @monthly_payment_months : '___________' %></span> months, due on or before the
          <span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_day"><%= @monthly_payment_day.present? ? @monthly_payment_day : '___________' %></span> day of each month, starting
          <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_start"><%= @monthly_payment_start.present? ? @monthly_payment_start : '___________' %></span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_final" data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_final ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          <strong>Final Payment:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="final_payment_amount"><%= @final_payment_amount.present? ? @final_payment_amount : '___________' %></span>
          due on or before <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="final_payment_date"><%= @final_payment_date.present? ? @final_payment_date : '___________' %></span> at 5:00 PM
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="payment_custom_schedule"
          data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_custom_schedule ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span><strong>Other Payment Schedule</strong></span>
      </div>
      <% if @agreement_editor_preview || @payment_custom_schedule %>
        <div data-agreement-conditional="payment_custom_schedule"
            data-agreement-conditional-value="1">

          <table class="custom-payment-schedule">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Payment</th>
                <th>Amount</th>
                <th>Due Date</th>
                <th>Due Time (if agreed)</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>

            <tbody>
              <% Array(@schedule).each do |index, amount, due_date| %>
                <tr data-agreement-payment-row="<%= index %>">
                  <td><%= index %></td>
                  <td>$<span data-agreement-field="amount<%= index %>"><%= amount %></span></td>
                  <td>
                    <span data-agreement-field="date<%= index %>"
                          data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= due_date %></span>
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    <% payment_time = instance_variable_get("@time#{index}").to_s %>
                    <% formatted_time = if payment_time.match?(/\A(?:[01]\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\d\z/)
                                          Time.strptime(payment_time, "%H:%M").strftime("%-I:%M %p")
                                        else
                                          "—"
                                        end %>
                    <span data-agreement-field="time<%= index %>"><%= formatted_time %></span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              <% end %>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <div data-agreement-payment-anchor></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <p><strong>Payment Method (Select all that apply):</strong></p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="online_portal">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('online_portal') ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Online portal (Note: Some portals do <strong>not</strong> accept partial payments. Tenant and Landlord must confirm in advance
        that this payment plan can be processed through the portal.)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="money_order">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('money_order') ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Money order</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="cashiers_check">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('cashiers_check') ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Cashier's check</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="payment_method"
          data-agreement-value="personal_check">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('personal_check') ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Personal check</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="payment_method"
          data-agreement-value="cash">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('cash') ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Cash</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="other">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('other') ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Other (describe): <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="payment_method_other_description"><%= @payment_method.to_s.split(',').include?('other') && @payment_method_other_description.present? ? @payment_method_other_description : '___________' %></span></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>
      <strong>Payments will be made to:</strong>
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="payment_recipient_instructions"><%= @payment_recipient_instructions.present? ? ERB::Util.html_escape(@payment_recipient_instructions) : '___________' %></span>
    </p>

    <p>
      Landlord will provide or make available a receipt or payment confirmation for each payment.
    </p>

    <p><strong>How Payments Will Be Applied (Select one):</strong></p>

    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="payment_application"
          data-agreement-value="standard">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_application == 'standard' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          Regular rent payments will be credited to the month identified,
          and additional payments will reduce the agreed payment amount in Section 2.
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="payment_application"
          data-agreement-value="different">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_application == 'different' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          Payments will be applied differently:
          <span class="field field-long"
                data-agreement-field="payment_application_instructions"><%= @payment_application_instructions.present? ? ERB::Util.html_escape(@payment_application_instructions) : '___________' %></span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p><strong>Conditional Reduction or Forgiveness (Select one):</strong></p>

    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item"
           data-agreement-choice="conditional_reduction"
           data-agreement-value="none">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @conditional_reduction == 'none' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>None.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="checkbox-item"
           data-agreement-choice="conditional_reduction"
           data-agreement-value="conditional">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @conditional_reduction == 'conditional' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          Landlord agrees not to collect
          $<span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="forgiveness_amount"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@forgiveness_amount.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>
          of the payment amount identified in Section 2 if Tenant completes
          the following payments or conditions by
          <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="forgiveness_deadline" data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= @forgiveness_deadline.present? ? Date.iso8601(@forgiveness_deadline).strftime('%B %-d, %Y') : '___________' %></span>:
          <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="forgiveness_conditions"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@forgiveness_conditions.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>
      Total additional payments required if these conditions are completed:
      $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="forgiveness_remaining_amount"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@forgiveness_remaining_amount.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>.
    </p>

    <p>
      If the conditions are not completed:
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="forgiveness_failure_result"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@forgiveness_failure_result.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>.
    </p>

    <p>
      The schedule above reflects this arrangement. Payments and reductions
      will not be counted twice.
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 3 -->
  <div class="page">
    <p>
      Payments must be made using a method accepted by both parties unless they agree otherwise in writing.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">

    <h3>4. Rental Assistance, If Applicable</h3>

    <p><strong>Select one:</strong></p>

    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="rental_assistance"
          data-agreement-value="none">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @rental_assistance == 'none' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>No rental assistance arrangement is included.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="checkbox-item"
          data-agreement-choice="rental_assistance"
          data-agreement-value="arrangement">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @rental_assistance == 'arrangement' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>The parties agree to the following arrangement:</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-agreement-conditional="rental_assistance"
        data-agreement-conditional-value="arrangement">

      <p>
        <strong>Program / provider:</strong>
        <span class="field field-long"
              data-agreement-field="assistance_provider"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@assistance_provider.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>
      </p>

      <p><strong>Application status:</strong></p>

      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <div class="checkbox-item"
            data-agreement-choice="assistance_status"
            data-agreement-value="not_submitted">
          <div class="checkbox<%= @assistance_status == 'not_submitted' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
          <span>Not submitted</span>
        </div>

        <div class="checkbox-item"
            data-agreement-choice="assistance_status"
            data-agreement-value="pending">
          <div class="checkbox<%= @assistance_status == 'pending' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
          <span>Pending</span>
        </div>

        <div class="checkbox-item"
            data-agreement-choice="assistance_status"
            data-agreement-value="approved">
          <div class="checkbox<%= @assistance_status == 'approved' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
          <span>Approved</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p><strong>Expected or approved amount:</strong></p>

      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <div class="checkbox-item"
            data-agreement-choice="assistance_amount_status"
            data-agreement-value="specified">
          <div class="checkbox<%= @assistance_amount_status == 'specified' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
          <span>
            $<span class="field field-medium"
                  data-agreement-field="assistance_amount"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@assistance_amount.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="checkbox-item"
            data-agreement-choice="assistance_amount_status"
            data-agreement-value="unknown">
          <div class="checkbox<%= @assistance_amount_status == 'unknown' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
          <span>Not yet known.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        <strong>If the amount is entered, is it confirmed?</strong>
        <span class="field field-short"
              data-agreement-field="assistance_confirmed"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@assistance_confirmed.to_s.presence || '___________') %></span>
      </p>

      <p>
        Landlord agrees to accept payments from the identified program on the
        agreed terms, consistent with applicable law and program requirements.
      </p>

    </div>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">

    <h3>5. Mediation and Communication</h3>

    <p>
      A mediator may review and support communication between the parties. Mediators do not give legal advice and
      cannot make decisions for the parties.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">

    <h3>6. If the Tenant Pays as Agreed</h3>

    <p>If the tenant makes <strong>all payments</strong> listed in Sections 3 and 4:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>The landlord will <strong>not</strong> file an eviction case based on the balance covered by this agreement.</li>
      <li>The tenant may <strong>remain in the property</strong>.</li>
      <li>Any pending eviction case will be dismissed by the next court date.</li>
    </ul>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">

    <h3>7. If the Tenant Does Not Pay as Agreed</h3>

    <p>
      If the Tenant(s) fail to make any payment as agreed, the landlord may proceed with an eviction action under <strong>ORC
      Chapter 1923</strong>.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">

    <h3>8. Additional Terms</h3>

    <p>Any additional terms agreed to by both parties are listed here:</p>

    <% if @additional_terms.present? %>
      <p data-agreement-field="additional_terms"><%= @additional_terms %></p>
    <% else %>
      <p class="field field-full" data-agreement-field="additional_terms">___________</p>
      <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
      <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
      <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
    <% end %>

    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">

    <h3>9. Signatures and Final Agreement</h3>

    <p>
      Both parties agree that this Agreement may be executed in one or more counterparts, each of which may be signed
      by a party individually. Upon execution by all parties, their respective signed copies of this Agreement shall be
      combined into a single, integrated document. The integrated agreement shall be deemed the final, complete, and
      enforceable version of this Agreement.
    </p>

    <div class="signature-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>
        <strong>Landlord:</strong>
        <span class="signature-line">___________</span>
        <span style="margin-left: 50px;"><strong>Date:</strong> <span class="date-line">___________</span></span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Tenant:</strong>
        <span class="signature-line">___________</span>
        <span style="margin-left: 50px;"><strong>Date:</strong> <span class="date-line">___________</span></span>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
